Note that some posting software (Outlook is infamous for it) strips
end-of-line spaces not only from lines of text, but also from .sig
delimiters, so newsreaders can't distinguish it. This is usually not the
poster's fault, apart from not staying away from broken software (and,
IMO, a whole broken operating system, but let's not go there). There *is*
a fix for the problem; someone who does use Windows can probably point to
